{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "e19e1f3620ad27c7512c5edb841e6fd06b3be689f612cce7f8f5b0816498ab0c", "ja": "茜ちゃんのサインが欲しいって？　しょうがないな～。\nじゃあみんな、並んで並んでっ！", "zh": "想要小茜的签名是吗？真拿你们没办法～\n那大家快排成一列吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9812559adc824064fb113ccdbbca944bdefd9c3c90930f3fe340393099753231", "ja": "（控え室に茜がいるみたいだな。\n……他にも、誰か来てるのか？）", "zh": "（茜好像在准备室里。\n……还有其他人在吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_1002_se", "source_sha256": "b8703c3059553d15c7ff50eefe79011dd74b664f4b3aff75b2aa244af9dbf40e", "ja": "ガチャッ！", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6edac02d1bb9a7bc4cddbac83d910551483b0909be4d5a0ff24e756c42ce1380", "ja": "茜、誰か来て……あれ？\n茜ひとりしかいない……？", "zh": "茜，有谁来了吗……咦？\n只有你一个人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "0a608c54641895092121b4add14d8dfbfe0b28ab191e6fa9ef3a84cb4e208622", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん……どうやら、\n茜ちゃんの秘密を知ってしまったようだね……。", "zh": "小{$P$}……看来，\n小茜的秘密被你发现了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_1005_p", "source_sha256": "afb60e3e746734379680f3407cc0e8b6b19039139e3b0962c16ddf97db25868f", "ja": "あ、茜の秘密……というと？", "zh": "茜、茜的秘密……是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "38cc8c9ef4a455ce5f8368a79f8fa59fb7c76acb8ef20ea3cefecb9390111735", "ja": "もちろん！　大勢のファンのみんなに、\nサインをお願いされたときのイメトレだよっ！", "zh": "那还用说！就是想像一大堆粉丝\n向小茜要签名的训练啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "d0d676cf9d94f5daaf0343740df02615e1ef9d274d819d066b1be331f0f5c689", "ja": "はい、というワケだから\n{$P$}ちゃんも付き合ってね！", "zh": "嗯，既然被你知道了，\n小{$P$}也来帮忙训练吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "bab35fb581c683ac14d0b8bc6c6421e224290fc89b87ff92db7e82ed5073ef36", "ja": "茜ちゃん達が出た『りるきゃん』のCMが\nすっごく評判いいのは、もちろん知ってるよね？", "zh": "小茜我们演出的《莉露甜心》广告大受好评，\n这你当然知道吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "d88864748a9060fca12df44c7a679c51cf680393a4fbf36808225be7ae7fad7c", "ja": "茜ちゃんは今や、国民的大人気アイドル！\n街を歩けば、たちまちファンに囲まれてしまうほどの！", "zh": "现在小茜可是当红国民偶像！\n一走在街上，马上就会被粉丝团团包围！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bb948eb4fd6fb2daeda4b503a44f66cdeb7f51a8219704a1e6a6722ef3ad0ca3", "ja": "茜……。", "zh": "茜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_1012", "source_sha256": "b4a4b092a3197a06bfb6364dc8749af62b484a755c5bef1b0d0808ed3bbf6363", "ja": "そのとおりだ！", "zh": "正是如此！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_2000_p", "source_sha256": "1d63035cf947028c2bbabc0ecc293776f836e32527ae61d35ae0b4f1e909db98", "ja": "そのとおりだ、茜！　あのCMを見て、\n茜のファンになる人がきっと大勢いるぞ！", "zh": "正是如此，茜！看了那支广告，\n肯定会有一大堆人成为你的粉丝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_2001_023aka", "source_sha256": "fa6129a2df476bb8bfbff5f995ca5379b74bb8242b04fe90393dc1d20a1f0cac", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん……。そうだよね！\n茜ちゃんのファン、いっぱい増えたよねっ！", "zh": "小{$P$}……没错！\n小茜的粉丝增加了很多，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_2002_p", "source_sha256": "8b1a42ea0f3fc31d8ac4db8b5a5bfd2c7aa5e9dfd17926b6eae6333eafd38261", "ja": "ああ！　中には、茜に会いたくて\n初めて劇場に来てくれるファンもいるはずだ！", "zh": "是啊！其中想必也有粉丝为了见茜一面\n而第一次踏进剧场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_2003_p", "source_sha256": "7cd95ae24d01da6d840ca2c69bd03397e43148ca250bdad2910ade355d34520c", "ja": "その人達は、ステージで歌い踊る茜の姿を見て、\nこう思うだろう……。", "zh": "当那些人看了茜在舞台上唱歌跳舞的模样，\n应该会这么想吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_2004_023aka", "source_sha256": "a39c521eb4511f89c99a5e805bb7c9f501dda13cede94e9d08d8cebf8b88add0", "ja": "え……何なに？　みんな、どんなことを思うの？\n茜ちゃんに教えて！　早く早くっ！", "zh": "咦……什么什么？他们会怎么想？\n快告诉小茜！快快快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_2005_p", "source_sha256": "2668abeb692f8cbba96db6e15dfff87a30610b920813de4dc4d257daeda3b874", "ja": "あのCMの女の子は、可愛いだけじゃなく、\nこんなにすごいパフォーマンスをするのかと！", "zh": "原来那支广告里的女孩子不只可爱，\n表演起来还这么精采！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_2006_023aka", "source_sha256": "a6b961e34a1c96ce1a782187b7638d3c6286b603b26e1f2704acd7e528847730", "ja": "おお……！　いいよ{$P$}ちゃん、\nもっと！　そういうの、もっとちょうだい！", "zh": "喔喔……！很好，小{$P$}！\n多说一点！再多称赞小茜一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_2007_p", "source_sha256": "e21310dfde4bee78336d9348a0d64af48ddabe20eff7da45a77cbb2297b3a5d2", "ja": "茜の人気は、さらに急上昇！\n茜ちゃんグッズの売り上げもうなぎ登りに……！", "zh": "茜的人气将进一步急遽上升！\n小茜周边商品的销售量也会扶摇直上……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_2008_023aka", "source_sha256": "06973bf1b2fab2c04472f48cf9bc34c507d105ecfe6ab37b639284b6af206368", "ja": "なんとっ！　CMの後に、\nこんな茜チャンスが待っていたとは……。", "zh": "竟然！想不到广告播出后，\n会有这么大的机会等着小茜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_2009_p", "source_sha256": "53e0a965cbe51f8adb2a1043423561ea187d6d11fc5a454481cc74e5a61d8891", "ja": "というわけだから、茜。\nこの後のレッスンも頑張ろうな！", "zh": "所以呢，茜。\n接下来的训练课程，要好好加油啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_2010_023aka", "source_sha256": "7584d1a530a0f83f1a7a278effc386cb0baa5a2fc6422d2f97ee2e41d86d2c31", "ja": "うん！　こうしちゃいられないね、\n{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "嗯！可不能安于现状呢，\n小{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_2011_023aka", "source_sha256": "e6fb228e82f343871c5ecf3ce94dfc38c2132df808cf49c4240abb08908f4961", "ja": "狙った獲物は逃さない！　茜ちゃん、新しいファンの\nハートを、がっちりキャッチしてみせるよ！", "zh": "不可以让煮熟的鸭子飞走！\n小茜会用力抓住新粉丝的心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0093_2012_p", "source_sha256": "b997ef1e9081cfa202ebdee5204e17be15d0e030fe89ae31cdb5f979938d0a55", "ja": "（やる気を、いい方向に向けてくれたみたいだ……。\nイメトレ、たまにはいいかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（看来她的干劲往好的方向发挥了……\n偶尔来点想像训练也不错呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
